---
layout: layout.njk
title: Download
faqs:
  - q: Is this 100% free accounting software?
    a: Yes. You can use the desktop edition for as long as you like, use all the features and enter as much data as required. There are no time limits, no usage limits, no ads.
  - q: If you give away your software for free, how do you make money?
    a: Desktop edition is single-user software. Businesses requiring multi-user capabilities or remote access will use <a href="https://www.manager.cloud" class="underline text-sky-500 underline-offset-4">cloud edition</a> which is not free.
  - q: If I'm working on Mac, can I send my file to an accountant who is on Windows?
    a: Yes. Manager data is cross-compatible across all operating systems. You can make a backup and restore on another computer with different operating system.
  - q: What happens to my data when I upgrade?
    a: When you upgrade to the latest version, your data will be automatically rolled-over. Still, we strongly recommend you make regular backups of your data whether you are upgrading or not.
---
